      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Notes: The *flash* is a visual indicator only. whether or not VRC adds an actual Camera Flash with light for dark areas is a different suggestion. The timer could  be text-based or also could be a light that blinks for each tick of the countdown. The goal is to provide accessibility, so the particulars of the implementation is up to the developer team.",
